    "parts": {
      "when": "[Your Charge phase](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase), after a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit of yours ends a **[charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move)**.",
      "target": "That **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit.",
      "effect": "Carry out these steps in order:\n\n1. Pick an enemy unit **[engaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** with the unit.\n2. Pick a model of the unit that is **engaged** with the picked enemy unit.\n3. Roll as many D6 as that model's T. For each 1, the unit takes a [mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds), and for each 5+, the enemy unit takes a mortal wound. Neither of the 2 units takes more than 6 mortal wounds this way."
    },
